error BYN3002: arena `arena` does not live as long as `plain`, which borrows it

  10 │         plain[name] = 1
     │               ^^^^ arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block
     │
  help: copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough

error BYN3002: arena `arena` does not live as long as `scoped`, which borrows it

  11 │         scoped[(name, 0)] = 1
     │                ^^^^^^^^^ arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block
     │
  help: copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
